This licence covers the MyoFLAME source code and the MyoFLAME model files in
myoflame/data/ (muscle response basis, activation surrogate, jaw calibration).
It does not cover third-party material, which keeps its own licence:

* FLAME 2020 (https://flame.is.tue.mpg.de) is not included; obtain it under the
  FLAME model licence. demos/build_viewer_data.py writes the viewer's FLAME data
  (viewer/data/flame.bin, verify.bin) from your own FLAME 2020 file; those files
  are subject to the FLAME model licence and are not part of this repository.
* myoflame/data/expressions.npz holds FLAME parameters averaged over the D3DFACS
  registrations of each FACS-coded expression; D3DFACS keeps its own licence.
* The surrogate was trained on FLAME fits of the LYHM identities and of D3DFACS;
  neither dataset is included.
* viewer/vendor/three.min.js is three.js (MIT licence, Copyright 2010-2021
  three.js authors).
